 * <li>8859_2 (ISO-8859-2/Latin-2)</li>
 * <li>8859_3 (ISO-8859-3/Latin-3)</li>
 * <li>8859_4 (ISO-8859-4/Latin-4)</li>
 * <li>8859_5 (ISO-8859-5/Latin-5)</li>
